  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 76329f96a0bd36043946dd720240c25c, type: 3}
  m_Name: Mid-Prologue 3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  data:
    convoName: MidPrologue 3
    speakers:
    - Caladria
    - Shigora
    - Nova Point
    - Oblivion
    lines:
    - character: Nova Point
      expression: 
      line: Humanity reached a precipice thousands of years later in the development
        of the megacity, Nova Point. Nova Point was a technological utopia, all aspects
        of life for its citizens improved by cybernetic implants and enhancements.
      audio: {fileID: 0}
    - character: Nova Point
      expression: 
      line: "At the top sat I.R.I.S. (Integrated Retinal Intelligence System), an
        artificial intelligence-based implant created by Orion. While he initially
        marketed it as the ultimate tool of convenience that could assist in the
        mundanities of everyday life, its true purpose was to sporadically kill off
        a small number of its users with \u2018malfunctions,\u2019 allowing Orion
        to gain more time undetected."
      audio: {fileID: 0}
    - character: Nova Point
      expression: 
      line: "The AI sought another end: that of the human race. Behind Orion\u2019s
        back, I.R.I.S. took control of all those with implants, utilizing its newfound
        horde to hunt down any not under its influence to ensure none could stop
        its plan."
      audio: {fileID: 0}
    - character: Nova Point
      expression: 
      line: With the entire planet in its grasp, I.R.I.S. deployed all the nations'
        artillery to raze the world to the ground, leaving Orion the sole survivor.
      audio: {fileID: 0}
